{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "防夹与排序",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 121.24,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "怎么防？分四层。",
   "spoken": "怎么防？分四层。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 3.133
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "用户这一层，把滑点设得合理。大额交易，走私有交易通道，比如 Flashbots Protect 一类的服务。",
   "spoken": "用户这一层，把滑点设得合理。大额交易，走私有交易通道，比如 Flashbots Protect 一类的服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 9.04,
   "speechStart": 3.58,
   "speechEnd": 12.424
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "交易不进公开内存池，搜索者在打包之前，就看不到它。",
   "spoken": "交易不进公开内存池，搜索者在打包之前，就看不到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 12.84,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 12.84,
   "speechEnd": 17.246
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "前端这一层，默认滑点要保守，按池子的深度来计算。",
   "spoken": "前端这一层，默认滑点要保守，按池子的深度来计算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 17.7,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 17.795,
   "speechEnd": 22.253
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "合约这一层，所有交换函数，都要接受最小输出和截止时间两个参数。",
   "spoken": "合约这一层，所有交换函数，都要接受最小输出和截止时间两个参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 22.72,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 22.72,
   "speechEnd": 29.154
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "常见的错误，是在合约内部，用现货价算出最小输出。",
   "spoken": "常见的错误，是在合约内部，用现货价算出最小输出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 29.58,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 29.675,
   "speechEnd": 34.641
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "那个现货价，在同一个区块里就能被推高。按它算出的保护，等于没有保护。",
   "spoken": "那个现货价，在同一个区块里就能被推高。按它算出的保护，等于没有保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 35.0,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 35.0,
   "speechEnd": 41.653
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "更糟的写法，是把最小输出直接写成 0。",
   "spoken": "更糟的写法，是把最小输出直接写成 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 42.1,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 42.202,
   "speechEnd": 45.604
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "这等于告诉所有人：我接受任何价格。金库、自动复投合约、清算合约，常犯这个错误。",
   "spoken": "这等于告诉所有人：我接受任何价格。金库、自动复投合约、清算合约，常犯这个错误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 46.0,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 46.0,
   "speechEnd": 53.514
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "协议设计这一层，有两种做法。",
   "spoken": "协议设计这一层，有两种做法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 53.9,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 53.9,
   "speechEnd": 56.049
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "一是提交揭示：先提交答案的哈希，下一阶段再公开答案。",
   "spoken": "一是提交揭示：先提交答案的哈希，下一阶段再公开答案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 56.52,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 56.613,
   "speechEnd": 61.831
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "这个承诺，必须绑定发送者的地址。不然，机器人复制你的承诺，也能完成揭示。",
   "spoken": "这个承诺，必须绑定发送者的地址。不然，机器人复制你的承诺，也能完成揭示。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 62.26,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 62.26,
   "speechEnd": 68.422
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "二是批量拍卖：同一批订单，按统一价格清算。",
   "spoken": "二是批量拍卖：同一批订单，按统一价格清算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 68.88,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 68.98,
   "speechEnd": 72.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "顺序由谁决定，每条链也不一样。",
   "spoken": "顺序由谁决定，每条链也不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 73.42,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 73.42,
   "speechEnd": 76.373
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "BNB Chain，验证者轮流出块。2026 年 1 月，出块间隔缩短到 0.45 秒。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain，验证者轮流出块。2026 年 1 月，出块间隔缩短到 0.45 秒。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 76.76,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 76.861,
   "speechEnd": 84.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "抢跑的窗口更短，但它有公开内存池和构建者市场，三明治依然存在。",
   "spoken": "抢跑的窗口更短，但它有公开内存池和构建者市场，三明治依然存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 84.66,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 84.753,
   "speechEnd": 91.411
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "TRON，27 个超级代表轮流出块。",
   "spoken": "TRON，27 个超级代表轮流出块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 91.84,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 91.84,
   "speechEnd": 95.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "按 TRON 官方文档，它没有优先费，不能靠出更高的价格插队。",
   "spoken": "按 TRON 官方文档，它没有优先费，不能靠出更高的价格插队。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 95.74,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 95.833,
   "speechEnd": 100.336
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "但出块的人，仍然可以决定顺序。",
   "spoken": "但出块的人，仍然可以决定顺序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 100.76,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 100.76,
   "speechEnd": 103.399
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "Mantle，只有一个中心化排序器。",
   "spoken": "Mantle，只有一个中心化排序器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 103.86,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 103.957,
   "speechEnd": 106.33
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "L2BEAT 列出的风险是：运营者可以抢跑用户交易，提取 MEV。",
   "spoken": "L2BEAT 列出的风险是：运营者可以抢跑用户交易，提取 MEV。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 106.8,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 106.895,
   "speechEnd": 111.99
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "没有公开内存池，不等于没有 MEV。",
   "spoken": "没有公开内存池，不等于没有 MEV。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 112.38,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 112.479,
   "speechEnd": 115.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "它只是把排序权，从市场集中到一个运营者手里。",
   "spoken": "它只是把排序权，从市场集中到一个运营者手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 115.88,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 115.88,
   "speechEnd": 119.85
  }
 ],
